<Layout title="About GameWire" description="Learn about GameWire and how its automated gaming news pipeline works.">
  <section class="prose-page"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p><h1>Gaming news, built for the web.</h1><p>GameWire is a static-first gaming news project designed around speed, discoverability and structured information.</p><h2>How it works</h2><p>News sources can be collected through RSS or Atom feeds, normalized into structured data, classified, and committed to the repository. Astro then generates static pages for every story, game, category and platform.</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Each story should clearly identify and link to its original source. GameWire should not republish copyrighted articles in full.</p></section>
</Layout>